Suggests: solaar
Description: GUI configurator for Logitech MX Master mice (via logiops)
 Qt (PySide6) frontend and profile adapter for the MX Master lineup on
 Debian/Ubuntu. Talks to logid (logiops) over D-Bus via a polkit helper
 and writes /etc/logid.cfg.
 .
 Named on-disk profiles live under ~/.config/mxmaster-cfg/profiles/
 (YAML/JSON). App-specific profiles are out of scope.
 .
 Licensed GPL-3.0-or-later. Do not run concurrently with Solaar/OpenLogi
 on the same HID++ device.
